<p>Since it seem like you really want to improve, I thought I would give you some info on what I noticed upon first glance:</p>
<ul>
<li>There's some formatting issues with the image clipping into the top bar.</li>
<li>Capitalizing the words &quot;containment breach&quot;.</li>
