<p>It's basically an object that does a thing with a bit of &quot;gore for the sake of gore&quot; thrown in for flavor, I suggest you take this idea back to the drawing board and visit the <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/forum/c-89000">Ideas Critique Forum</a> before posting again and I highly encourage you to follow through the process of feedback and criticism to make a better anomaly the next time.</p>

