<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> Site Dossier</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Horror, History, Other</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> A site in imaginative space, to contain pataphysical/noospherical anomalies.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> The site is created/constructed by linking the disembodied brains of former reality benders/anartists/ etc. to a massive computational device simulating said site. All information of the to-be-contained pataphysical/noospherical entities is given/shown to the brains so they can perceive said information and <em>imprison</em> the anomalies via their perception.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The consciousness of the brains are themselves contained in the site. It is not revealed how the brains got separated from their bodies, but it is specified that it was an unintended occurence and the Foundation took simply advantage.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> As the site is only managed by non-sapient/sentient machines, to prevent an informational containment breach, it is under heavy criticism of worried Foundation researchers. (Additionally the site itself might accidentally create new pataphysical entities for containment.)</p>

