			<div class="content" id="post-content-4844466">
									

<p>Hello hello <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sputnik-one" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7005588); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7005588&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607943550" alt="Sputnik One" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7005588)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sputnik-one" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7005588); return false;">Sputnik One</a></span>! Welcome to the Wiki! I'm Ralliston, a site author and a member of the Community Outreach Team - with this helpful little comment, I'll try to help you find your way around the site and link a bunch of useful places and links that will help you in your SCP journey.</p>
<p>Well, as much as I believe you probably already know most of the stuff I'll say in this post, I'm sure you'll find at least one bit of helpful information - after all, you never know! Getting your first article to survive, especially as a coldpost, is quite impressive - I can't wait for what you'll write when you get critique - I'm sure it will be amazing! I can't wait to see what you come up with in the future!</p>
<p>Without further ado though, let's click the collapsible, shall we? :)</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
